{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"793","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"上市櫃年報 拚3月底如期公告","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">2020-02-07 03:21</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">經濟日報 記者葉憶如、邱金蘭／台北報導</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E5%B9%B4%E5%A0%B1.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">到大陸投資上市櫃公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1,200</span>多家，約二成未完成去年度財報查核，金管會請會計師事務所<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">15</span>日前完成盤點，希望<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月底前能如期公告去年財報。 （本報系資料庫）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">武漢肺炎疫情蔓延，上市櫃公司財報公告受波及，金管會昨（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>）日與四大會計師事務所研商達成共識，原則如期<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月底公告財報，並採替代查核方式，解決無法派人到大陸查核問題，替代查核方式仍無法解決者則採個案處理。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">根據金管會資料，到大陸投資的上市櫃公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1,200</span>多家，約二成未完成去年度財報的查核，昨天金管會請會計師事務所，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">15</span>日前完成盤點，了解有多少家公司需採用替代查核方式。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">台灣的會計師事務所因武漢肺炎疫情，無法派人到大陸執行審計工作，金管會昨天找證交所、櫃買中心、四大會計師事務所及會計師公會，研商替代查核程序方式可行性等問題，金管會官員表示，會中達成共識，希望財報如期<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月底前出來，並出具無保留意見。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">官員表示，與會者多認為，財報公告時間若全面延期，對資本市場衝擊太大，大家仍以如期申報為目標。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">至於二成尚未完成查核程序的上市櫃公司，可採取替代查核程序方式解決，金管會將儘速發函，讓會計師及上市櫃公司有所依循。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">替代查核程序方式是指無法派人到大陸執行查核工作情況下，函證可由大陸當地聯盟所出具，例如由上海勤業的會計師協助等，來完成查核工作。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">昨天會中也討論到一些跨境掛牌公司，如美國等海外當地主管機關能否接納替代查核方式，四大會計師事務所說明，美國要求標準較高，不過替代查核方式在實務執行上，應可做到符合美國要求，問題不大。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">至於上交所宣布財報公告從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月底延到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月底，因以往兩地掛牌公司（大陸子公司在當地掛牌、母公司在台掛牌）財報都是同步公告，大陸掛牌子公司財報若無法如期公告，母公司合併報表財報也出不來，這會影響國內上市櫃公司財報出來時間。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">昨天會中多位會計師說明，因大陸部分城市尚未開工，大陸子公司可能要等到開工後，才能確知有多少家子公司財報延到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月底、或可以如期在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月底出來。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://money.udn.com/money/story/12926/4327250</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-02-10","clk_count":"227"}},"__N_SSG":true}